#: lib/tuist_web/live/ops_account_live.html.heex:471
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "An Air account can reach the cache until it uses %{egress} of cache egress or %{requests} cache requests a month. Resetting starts the count over from now, so the account is unblocked and has the full allowance again for the rest of the month. It is not an exemption: the reset goes inert on the first of next month, when counting returns to the month boundary."
msgstr "Air 帳戶可以使用快取，直到其每月使用量達到 %{egress} 的快取出站流量或 %{requests} 次快取請求為止。重設會從現在開始重新計算，因此帳戶將解除封鎖，並在當月剩餘時間內恢復完整配額。這並非豁免：重設將在下一個月的第一天失效，屆時計算將回歸至月份邊界。"

